1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:01,510
She locked me in.

2
00:00:01,510 --> 00:00:03,120
Then she told me why.

3
00:00:03,320 --> 00:00:04,970
One word. Lie.

4
00:00:05,380 --> 00:00:05,920
Vale lied?

5
00:00:05,920 --> 00:00:06,570
I'm shocked.

6
00:00:06,570 --> 00:00:06,730
No.

7
00:00:06,730 --> 00:00:07,270
I'm lying.

8
00:00:07,270 --> 00:00:08,440
I'm not shocked.

9
00:00:08,630 --> 00:00:10,680
She had tried his trade already.

10
00:00:10,680 --> 00:00:11,390
Last night.

11
00:00:11,390 --> 00:00:12,460
My tomorrow.

12
00:00:12,760 --> 00:00:14,440
She gave herself up for Mom.

13
00:00:14,440 --> 00:00:16,070
And he kept them both.

14
00:00:16,670 --> 00:00:19,400
It's eleven fifty
nine, Miss Reyes.

15
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:21,140
Zip, get behind me.

16
00:00:21,240 --> 00:00:22,690
No. I was a bouncer.

17
00:00:22,890 --> 00:00:24,850
What is that cat doing?

18
00:00:25,050 --> 00:00:26,300
You're not on the list!

19
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:30,000
He burned so bright that
Vale covered his eyes.

20
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:31,270
The door was open.

21
00:00:31,270 --> 00:00:33,410
And only one of us could leave.

22
00:00:33,610 --> 00:00:34,840
So I picked.

23
00:00:35,640 --> 00:00:36,990
Mara! No! Mara!

24
00:00:37,790 --> 00:00:39,260
I tried to say goodbye.

25
00:00:39,260 --> 00:00:40,710
No sound came out.
